            <div xml:id="d785">

                <pb facs="0998" n="896" sameAs="frus:frus1935v01/pg896"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">765.84/2937: Telegram</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Chargé in Ethiopia</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                        >Engert</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to the Secretary of State </hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Addis Ababa</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1935-12-06T16:00:00+02:35">December 6, 1935—4
                            p.m.</date>
                        <lb/> [Received December 6—2:10 p.m.]</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>209. Dessie was bombed this morning between 8 and 9 o’clock by about 10 Italian
                    planes. American Seventh Day Adventists Hospital marked with Red Cross said to
                    have been struck but no one hurt although two rooms said to have been destroyed.
                    No foreigners reported killed or wounded, but about 25 natives. Reports so far
                    conflicting. Shall report further as soon as I receive reliable news.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Engert</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
